      "description": "Paired zoom controls with a shared outline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-zoom\" aria-label=\"Map zoom\"><button class=\"ds-button\" aria-label=\"Zoom in\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-button\" aria-label=\"Zoom out\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-zoom{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line,#6b8184);border-radius:3px;overflow:visible}.ds-button{font-family:\"Noto Sans\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#283b42);width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;background:var(--paper,#ffffff);border:0;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 120ms ease-out;}.ds-zoom .ds-button:first-child{border-radius:2px 2px 0 0}.ds-zoom .ds-button+ .ds-button{border-top:1px solid #c2ccce;border-radius:0 0 2px 2px}.ds-button:hover:not(:disabled){background:#e4eded}.ds-button:active:not(:disabled){background:#d4e0df}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#175c6f);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button:disabled{color:#8a979b;cursor:default}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button{transition-duration:0ms}}"
